[[Amulet of Steel]] is a rare item normally obtained by buying the [[Unidentified Amulet]] from the shop. The 30 {{icon/block}} gained is fairly significant as a baseline, but with other {{icon/block}}-giving items as well, such as [[Armor]]s, it can also give a large amount of {{icon/empower}} early in the fight, which is great for weapon builds.

